      "url": "https://www.apu.edu/oir/commondata/",
      "summary": "The Common Data Set (CDS) at Azusa Pacific University provides standardized statistical information about students, faculty, and staff, used for external representation. It aims to minimize conflicting data across publications and reduce the effort needed to respond to survey requests. The CDS has been a collaborative initiative since 1995, involving major educational data publishers such as the College Board, Peterson's Guides, and U.S. News & World Report.",
